      "role": "user",
      "content": "idk i was reading about how big the universe actually is tonight and i just feel so small. like, everything we do, every feeling, every struggle... it's just nothing. a tiny bit of noise in a massive vacuum that doesn't even care we exist. it makes everything feel so pointless.",
