    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but that \"personal meaning\" feels so fake. like, if a billion years from now everything is just gone and nothing was ever recorded, does it actually matter if i found \"meaning\" for a second today? it feels like just being distracted from the reality that we're all just biological accidents that don't actually mean anything.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
